{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/\u8001\u90d1\u5bf9\u8bdd.png?t=1743858811\" />An experimental accident in theoretical physics occurred in Qianhai City, leaving the local law enforcement agencies clueless, forcing them to seek assistance from you, ITEO Special Investigator Zenmeil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/\u5c0f\u533a\u95e8\u53e3.png?t=1743858811\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Investigate the cause of the accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/image_14.png?t=1743858811\" />Enter the inner world of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/image_15.png?t=1743858811\" />Explore the secrets of the inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/image_18.png?t=1743858811\" />Encounter and resolve battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/image_13.png?t=1743858811\" />This is your only chance to return to &quot;Myth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678750/extras/image_19.png?t=1743858811\" />Freedom, power, salvation, eternity, or truth, choose your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http